[14.511485, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[14.542661, "o", "AWS Service Authorization Reference · read live, no account needed\r\n\r\nservice prefix       actions   write  permissions  no resource\r\n"]
[14.705799, "o", "bedrock:*                269     138            1           66\r\n"]
[14.744205, "o", "bedrock-mantle:*          38      20            0            3\r\n"]
[14.798933, "o", "bedrock-agentcore:*      258     149            8           48\r\n"]
[14.895698, "o", "sagemaker:*              460     259            0           96\r\n\r\nA few actions from this module:\r\n"]
[14.895862, "o", "  bedrock:InvokeModel                                        read/list  resources: application-inference-profile, async-invoke, bedrock-marketplace-model-endpoint, custom-model-deployment, default-prompt-router, foundation-model, imported-model, inference-profile, project, prompt-router, provisioned-model, system-tool\r\n  bedrock:CallWithBearerToken                                read/list  resources: none (only *)\r\n"]
[14.895956, "o", "  bedrock:DeleteModelInvocationLoggingConfiguration          write      resources: none (only *)\r\n  bedrock:CreateProvisionedModelThroughput                   write      resources: custom-model, foundation-model\r\n  bedrock-mantle:CreateInference                             write      resources: project\r\n\r\nThese 4 AI prefixes together: 1025 IAM actions. A chatbot calls a handful of them.\r\n"]
