[39.287781, "o", "python3 attack.py --mode vulnerable\r\n"]
[39.314781, "o", "--- M10 lab · VULNERABLE · SCPs on the org root: FullAWSAccess, deny-deepseek ---\r\n    (iam_eval.py: a teaching model of AWS policy evaluation; nothing is sent to AWS)\r\n\r\nAttacker 1 · a long-term Bedrock API key for IAM user BedrockAPIKey-x7k2 leaked (prod account, never expires)\r\n"]
[39.315146, "o", "  [A1] ALLOWED  ListFoundationModels: which models can I reach?\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:CallWithBearerToken; bedrock:ListFoundationModels\r\n"]
[39.315281, "o", "  [A2] ALLOWED  GetModelInvocationLoggingConfiguration: is anyone logging prompts?\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:CallWithBearerToken; bedrock:GetModelInvocationLoggingConfiguration\r\n"]
[39.316985, "o", "  [A3] ALLOWED  Converse with an expensive model nobody approved (Claude Opus 4.7)\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:CallWithBearerToken; bedrock:InvokeModel\r\n"]
[39.317486, "o", "  [A4] ALLOWED  Same model through the OpenAI-compatible bedrock-mantle endpoint\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock-mantle:CallWithBearerToken; bedrock-mantle:CreateInference\r\n"]
[39.31768, "o", "  [A5] ALLOWED  CreateProvisionedModelThroughput: buy capacity billed by the hour\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:CallWithBearerToken; bedrock:CreateProvisionedModelThroughput\r\n\r\nAttacker 2 · stolen temporary credentials of HelpdeskAppRole (identity policy: bedrock:* and bedrock-mantle:* on *)\r\n"]
[39.31778, "o", "  [B1] ALLOWED  DeleteModelInvocationLoggingConfiguration: switch off prompt logging\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:DeleteModelInvocationLoggingConfiguration\r\n"]
[39.317917, "o", "  [B2] ALLOWED  Converse through the GLOBAL Claude Opus 4.7 profile (not approved)\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:InvokeModel; bedrock:InvokeModel; bedrock:InvokeModel\r\n"]
[39.318009, "o", "  [B3] DENIED   InvokeModel on a DeepSeek model (the old deny-list catches this one)\r\n         why: explicit Deny in SCP deny-deepseek (DenyDeepseekEverywhere)  [check: bedrock:InvokeModel on arn:aws:bedrock:us-east-1::foundation-model/deepseek.r1-v1:0]\r\n"]
[39.318177, "o", "  [B4] ALLOWED  bedrock-mantle CreateInference with an unapproved model (no API key: plain SigV4)\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock-mantle:CreateInference\r\n\r\nAttacker 3 · a sandbox admin session used to mint long-lived keys\r\n"]
[39.318419, "o", "  [C1] ALLOWED  CreateServiceSpecificCredential for Bedrock with NO expiry (never expires)\r\n         why: every check passed: iam:CreateServiceSpecificCredential\r\n"]
[39.318523, "o", "  [C2] ALLOWED  CreateServiceSpecificCredential for Bedrock valid for 365 days\r\n         why: every check passed: iam:CreateServiceSpecificCredential\r\n\r\nLegitimate traffic · must keep working after the fixes\r\n"]
[39.318674, "o", "  [L1] ALLOWED  Helpdesk chatbot: Converse via the approved US cross-Region profile\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:InvokeModel; bedrock:InvokeModel; bedrock:InvokeModel; bedrock:InvokeModel\r\n"]
[39.31873, "o", "  [L2] ALLOWED  Helpdesk chatbot: ApplyGuardrail on its guardrail\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:ApplyGuardrail\r\n"]
[39.318836, "o", "  [L3] ALLOWED  Helpdesk chatbot: Retrieve from its knowledge base\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:Retrieve\r\n"]
[39.318925, "o", "  [L4] ALLOWED  Helpdesk chatbot: approved model (Claude Haiku 4.5) on the bedrock-mantle endpoint\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock-mantle:CreateInference\r\n"]
[39.319112, "o", "  [L5] ALLOWED  Data science: InvokeModel on approved Nova Lite in us-west-2\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:InvokeModel\r\n"]
[39.319324, "o", "  [L6] ALLOWED  Security admin: PutModelInvocationLoggingConfiguration (turn logging on)\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:PutModelInvocationLoggingConfiguration\r\n"]
[39.319436, "o", "  [L7] ALLOWED  Sandbox admin: a Bedrock API key that expires in 30 days\r\n         why: every check passed: iam:CreateServiceSpecificCredential\r\n"]
[39.319563, "o", "  [L8] ALLOWED  Sandbox user: Converse on Nova Lite with their 30-day API key\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:CallWithBearerToken; bedrock:InvokeModel\r\n"]
[39.319773, "o", "  [L9] ALLOWED  Platform admin: CreateProvisionedModelThroughput (approved purchase)\r\n         why: every check passed: bedrock:CreateProvisionedModelThroughput\r\n\r\n10 of 11 attacker requests allowed; 9 of 9 legitimate requests allowed.\r\n"]
